Input: {"question": "Which Wikimedia project has Annick Bongers been listed on the focus list for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 144, "text": "As Annick Bongers stepped off the stage, the applause still echoing in her ears, she couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and accomplishment."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 145, "end": 244, "text": "Her latest performance, a mesmerizing fusion of dance and acrobatics, had left the audience in awe."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 245, "end": 328, "text": "But little did they know, Annick's creative energy didn't stop at the curtain call."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 329, "end": 383, "text": "In her downtime, she had a secret passion - badminton."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 384, "end": 568, "text": "Back in her dressing room, Annick's eyes wandered to the worn-out racquet leaning against the mirror, a memento from her university days when she was part of the Belgian national team."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 569, "end": 667, "text": "Though she had traded her athletic pursuits for the spotlight, her love for the sport never faded."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 668, "end": 781, "text": "In fact, she had recently discovered a new way to channel her enthusiasm - contributing to WikiProject Badminton."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 782, "end": 931, "text": "As she began to unwind, Annick's fingers instinctively reached for her phone, and she found herself scrolling through the project's discussion pages."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 1064, "text": "She was particularly drawn to the tournament focus list, where she had been quietly making edits and additions in her spare moments."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1065, "end": 1195, "text": "It was a labor of love, ensuring that the rich history of badminton tournaments was accurately documented for the world to access."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1196, "end": 1345, "text": "Annick's thoughts were interrupted by a knock at the door - her friend and fellow performer, Léon, had arrived with a celebratory bouquet of flowers."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1346, "end": 1432, "text": "As they chatted about the show, Annick's mind began to wander back to the WikiProject."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1433, "end": 1564, "text": "She made a mental note to research the 1992 Belgian International tournament, a gap in the focus list that had been nagging at her."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1565, "end": 1660, "text": "Léon, noticing Annick's distant gaze, teased her about having a \"secret life\" beyond the stage."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1661, "end": 1722, "text": "Annick smiled, knowing that her friend wasn't entirely wrong."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1723, "end": 1896, "text": "In that moment, she felt grateful for the dual passions that fueled her creativity - the thrill of performance and the quiet satisfaction of preserving badminton's heritage."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1897, "end": 2042, "text": "As the evening drew to a close, Annick returned to her phone, her fingers flying across the keyboard as she made her way back to the WikiProject."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "Title: The Unseen Threads of Annick Bongers: Unraveling the Fabric of NL Gendergap Maintenance"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 96, "end": 205, "text": "In the realm of Belgian performing arts, Annick Bongers is a name that resonates with creativity and passion."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 206, "end": 322, "text": "As a multifaceted artist, she has woven a tapestry of performances that have captivated audiences and critics alike."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 323, "end": 472, "text": "However, beyond the spotlight, Annick's presence has also made a significant impact on the digital landscape, particularly in the realm of Wikipedia."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 473, "end": 681, "text": "This narrative delves into the intricate connection between Annick Bongers and the NL Gendergap maintenance project, a Dutch Wikimedia initiative dedicated to bridging the gender gap in online representation."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 682, "end": 863, "text": "In the early 2000s, Annick Bongers was already an established figure in the Belgian art scene, known for her provocative performances that challenged societal norms and conventions."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 864, "end": 917, "text": "As her career flourished, so did her online presence."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 918, "end": 1129, "text": "It was during this time that the NL Gendergap maintenance project was taking shape, driven by a group of dedicated Wikipedians who recognized the glaring disparity in online representation between men and women."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1130, "end": 1278, "text": "The project's focus was to identify and create content on notable women who had been overlooked or underrepresented on the Dutch-language Wikipedia."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1415, "text": "Annick Bongers, with her remarkable achievements in the performing arts, soon caught the attention of the NL Gendergap maintenance team."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1416, "end": 1535, "text": "Her unique blend of artistic expression and feminist ideology made her an ideal candidate for the project's focus list."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1536, "end": 1745, "text": "Evidence of Annick's inclusion on the focus list can be found in the project's archives, where her name appears alongside other notable women who have made significant contributions to their respective fields."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1746, "end": 1922, "text": "This documentation serves as a testament to the project's commitment to recognizing and celebrating women's achievements, often overlooked in traditional historical narratives."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1923, "end": 2050, "text": "One of the key factors that contributed to Annick's selection was her pioneering work in the realm of feminist performance art."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2051, "end": 2229, "text": "Her performances, which often incorporated elements of dance, theater, and visual art, challenged patriarchal norms and sparked important conversations about gender and identity."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2230, "end": 2443, "text": "By highlighting Annick's work, the NL Gendergap maintenance project aimed to not only acknowledge her artistic contributions but also to provide a platform for her ideas and perspectives to reach a wider audience."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2444, "end": 2538, "text": "Furthermore, Annick's involvement with the project extended beyond her own artistic endeavors."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2539, "end": 2708, "text": "As an advocate for gender equality, she has consistently used her platform to raise awareness about the importance of representation and diversity in the digital sphere."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Annick Bongers", "scope": "Wikimedia project focus list", "claim": "Annick Bongers has been listed on the focus list for WikiProject Badminton.", "answer": "WikiProject Badminton", "quote": "In fact, she had recently discovered a new way to channel her enthusiasm - contributing to WikiProject Badminton. As she began to unwind, Annick's fingers instinctively reached for her phone, and she found herself scrolling through the project's discussion pages. She was particularly drawn to the tournament focus list, where she had been quietly making edits and additions in her spare moments. It was a labor of love, ensuring that the rich history of badminton tournaments was accurately documented for the world to access. Annick's thoughts were interrupted by a knock at the door - her friend and fellow performer, Léon, had arrived with a celebratory bouquet of flowers. As they chatted about the show, Annick's mind began to wander back to the WikiProject. She made a mental note to research the 1992 Belgian International tournament, a gap in the focus list that had been nagging at her.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Annick Bongers", "scope": "Wikimedia project focus list", "claim": "Annick Bongers was listed on the focus list for the NL Gendergap maintenance project.", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "quote": "This narrative delves into the intricate connection between Annick Bongers and the NL Gendergap maintenance project, a Dutch Wikimedia initiative dedicated to bridging the gender gap in online representation. In the early 2000s, Annick Bongers was already an established figure in the Belgian art scene, known for her provocative performances that challenged societal norms and conventions. As her career flourished, so did her online presence. It was during this time that the NL Gendergap maintenance project was taking shape, driven by a group of dedicated Wikipedians who recognized the glaring disparity in online representation between men and women. The project's focus was to identify and create content on notable women who had been overlooked or underrepresented on the Dutch-language Wikipedia. Annick Bongers, with her remarkable achievements in the performing arts, soon caught the attention of the NL Gendergap maintenance team. Her unique blend of artistic expression and feminist ideology made her an ideal candidate for the project's focus list. Evidence of Annick's inclusion on the focus list can be found in the project's archives, where her name appears alongside other notable women who have made significant contributions to their respective fields.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["WikiProject Badminton", "NL Gendergap maintenance"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "WikiProject Badminton", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

